msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「What's going on? We were just here＿earlier.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué pasa? Si ya estuvimos＿aquí hace un rato.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......My sweeper's instinct is telling＿me...... that something is here......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Mi instinto de limpiador me＿dice...... que aquí hay algo......」"

msgid "Ami「Whaaat～? What's the \"something\"?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Quéee～? ¿Qué es ese \"algo\"?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí.」"

msgid "Ami「You have fun with that. Ami-chan's off＿to take a break over on that bench～」"
msgstr "Ami「Diviértete con eso. Ami-chan se＿va a descansar en aquel banco～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Maybe I can't expect normal people to＿understand...... but my instincts don't＿lie! I'm gonna clean!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Tal vez no pueda esperar que la gente＿normal entienda...... ¡pero mi instinto＿no miente! ¡Voy a limpiar!）」"

msgid "Ami「What's that? Isn't that our teacher＿hanging up grocery bags over there?」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué es eso? ¿Esa de allá no＿es nuestra profesora llevando＿bolsas de compras?」"

msgid "Yuri「Wife...... Wife......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Esposa...... Esposa......」"

msgid "Taiga「She's mumbling to herself with this＿dark aura hanging over her. Creepy.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Está murmurando para sí misma con un＿aura oscura encima. Qué escalofriante.」"

msgid "Ami「She probably just got rejected by yet＿another man, right? Awww, poor thing.」"
msgstr "Ami「Seguro que otro hombre más la acaba＿de rechazar, ¿no? Awww, pobrecita.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What!? She's our teacher?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Qué?! ¿Ella es nuestra profesora?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't be ridiculous...... So, that person＿is a teacher at our high school, is that＿right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No digas tonterías...... Entonces,＿esa persona es profesora de nuestra＿preparatoria, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「Koigakubo Yuri. Our homeroom＿teacher. Done.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Koigakubo Yuri. Nuestra profesora＿titular. Listo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait, that's all there is to her?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Espera, ¿eso es todo sobre ella?」"

msgid "Taiga「That's all that needs to be said about＿her.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso es todo lo que hace falta＿decir sobre ella.」"

msgid "Ami「Well, in addition～ She's a single woman＿in her thirties. Someone whose＿footsteps no one would want to follow.」"
msgstr "Ami「Bueno, además～ Es una mujer soltera＿de treinta y tantos. Alguien cuyos＿pasos nadie querría seguir.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's a terrible thing to say......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué cosa tan terrible dices......」"

msgid "Yuri「Oh, it's you guys. You've come at just＿the right time!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Ah, son ustedes. ¡Llegaron＿justo a tiempo!」"

msgid "Ami「Like, what's wrong, Sensei?」"
msgstr "Ami「O sea, ¿qué pasa, Sensei?」"

msgid "Yuri「Do I look like a wife?」"
msgstr "Yuri「¿Parezco una esposa?」"

msgid "Taiga「Come again?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Cómo dices?」"

msgid "Ami「Hmmm, you don't give off a \"wifey\" feel＿to me. Doesn't really come natural to＿you～」"
msgstr "Ami「Mmmm, no me da vibras de \"esposa\".＿Como que no le sale natural～」"

msgid "Yuri「Of course not...... It doesn't, does it?」"
msgstr "Yuri「Claro que no...... No parezco, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Did something happen?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pasó algo?」"

msgid "Yuri「Earlier, while I was grocery shopping,＿the employee called me \"ma'am\".」"
msgstr "Yuri「Hace rato, mientras hacía las compras,＿el empleado me llamó \"señora\".」"

msgid "Ami「Hmmm, isn't that rude, since you're＿still a \"miss\"?」"
msgstr "Ami「Mmmm, ¿no es grosero eso, siendo＿que aún es \"señorita\"?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not to be rude, but plenty of people＿get married at your age, Sensei......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sin ánimo de ofender, pero mucha gente＿se casa a su edad, Sensei......」"

msgid "Yuri「Yeah...... I realized that, and it occurred＿to me that I could look at it that way.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Sí...... Me di cuenta de eso, y se me＿ocurrió que podía verlo de esa manera.」"

msgid "Yuri「I didn't look like a single woman...... In＿other words, I look like a successful＿married woman!」"
msgstr "Yuri「No parecía una mujer soltera......＿En otras palabras, ¡parezco una＿mujer casada y exitosa!」"

msgid "Taiga「What? You're happy about that?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué? ¿Le alegra eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now I get it......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora entiendo......」"

msgid "Yuri「That's why I wasn't sure whether I＿should be happy or sad......」"
msgstr "Yuri「Por eso no sabía si debería＿estar feliz o triste......」"

msgid "Taiga「Tch......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tch......」"

msgid "Ami「Sensei ① There's really nothing to＿worry about. It's up to you how to＿interpret it.」"
msgstr "Ami「Sensei ① De verdad no hay nada＿de qué preocuparse. Depende de＿usted cómo interpretarlo.」"

msgid "Yuri「Up to me...... *Gasp*!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Depende de mí...... ¡Ah!」"

msgid "Yuri「Y-You're right. I'll correct that＿employee by telling him I'm single.」"
msgstr "Yuri「T-Tienen razón. Corregiré a ese empleado＿diciéndole que soy soltera.」"

msgid "Everyone「What?」"
msgstr "Todos「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Yuri「Yes, that employee saw me as a＿successful woman. He can't possibly＿have a bad impression of me!」"
msgstr "Yuri「Sí, ese empleado me vio como una mujer＿exitosa. ¡Es imposible que tenga una＿mala impresión de mí!」"

msgid "Yuri「Perhaps it's possible that employee is＿single too, and you never know - this＿could be an opportune meeting.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Tal vez ese empleado también sea＿soltero, y nunca se sabe: este podría＿ser un encuentro oportuno.」"

msgid "Yuri「Thanks, you three. I'll report back if＿anything good happens.」"
msgstr "Yuri「Gracias, chicos. Les informaré＿si pasa algo bueno.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She really did leave......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「De verdad se fue......」"

msgid "Ami「Ugggh. When you're a late bloomer,＿you might lose sight of yourself and＿end up like that. Scary～」"
msgstr "Ami「Agh. Si tardas en encontrar pareja,＿puedes perder el rumbo y terminar＿así. Qué miedo～」"

msgid "Taiga「Hadn't you best learn that lesson,＿StuChi? You and Sensei have the＿same stench.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿No sería mejor que aprendieras＿la lección, StuChi? Tú y Sensei＿tienen el mismo tufo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「*Sigh*...... They started another fight......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「*Suspiro*...... Empezaron＿otra pelea......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'll leave them be for now. In the＿meantime, I'll......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Las dejaré así por ahora. Mientras＿tanto, voy a......）」"

msgid "Check up on Sensei"
msgstr "Ir a ver a Sensei"

msgid "Clean"
msgstr "Limpiar"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'll go see how Sensei plans to＿approach the employee......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Iré a ver cómo planea Sensei＿acercarse al empleado......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Wait, what am I thinking?! As if I＿could really be that tactless!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Espera, ¡¿qué estoy pensando?!＿¡Como si pudiera ser tan indiscreto!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'll wait here like a good boy until the＿fight between Taiga and Kawashima＿subsides.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Esperaré aquí como buen chico＿hasta que se calme la pelea entre＿Taiga y Kawashima.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I know, I'll tidy up around here. My＿instinct is telling me...... something is＿here......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Ya sé, ordenaré por aquí.＿Mi instinto me dice...... que＿aquí hay algo......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Oho?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Oh?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（This is a pair of planetarium tickets......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Esto es un par de entradas＿para el planetario......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Wait! If I use these, maybe...... That's＿it!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¡Espera! Si las uso,＿tal vez...... ¡Eso es!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'll need to thank Noto properly＿sometime later, but for now, I'm gonna＿use these!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Tendré que agradecerle bien＿a Noto más adelante, ¡pero por＿ahora voy a usarlas!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Hm......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Mmm......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（An empty can, huh. If you're going to＿leave it, at least try to leave it near the＿wastebasket......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Una lata vacía, eh. Si la vas a dejar＿tirada, al menos intenta dejarla cerca＿del cesto de basura......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......*Sigh* I'll throw it away.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......*Suspiro* La tiraré.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Couldn't find anything......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No pude encontrar nada......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......And cleaning's done.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Y limpieza terminada.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Couldn't find anything......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No pude encontrar nada......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji! I'm sick of waiting!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuji! ¡Me cansé de esperar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, alright. Let's go.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, bueno. Vámonos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（My instinct...... failed me......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Mi instinto...... me falló......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'll go see how Sensei plans to＿approach the employee......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Iré a ver cómo planea Sensei＿acercarse al empleado......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Wait, what am I thinking?! As if I＿could really be that tactless!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Espera, ¡¿qué estoy pensando?!＿¡Como si pudiera ser tan indiscreto!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'll wait here like a good boy until the＿fight between Taiga and Kawashima＿subsides.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Esperaré aquí como buen chico＿hasta que se calme la pelea entre＿Taiga y Kawashima.）」"

msgid "Taiga「*Sigh*...... Good lord, I should pat myself＿on the back for putting up with this＿freak...... In short, you just want to」"
msgstr "Taiga「*Suspiro*...... Dios mío, debería＿felicitarme por aguantar a este＿rarito...... En resumen, solo quieres」"

msgid "Taiga「clean, don't you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「limpiar, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ami「Oh, you didn't know, huh? Having to＿catch you up on every little thing is＿such a pain～ Can you just get your」"
msgstr "Ami「Ah, no lo sabías, ¿eh? Tener que ponerte＿al día con cada detallito es un＿fastidio～ ¿Ya puedes recuperar tu」"

msgid "Ami「memory back already?」"
msgstr "Ami「memoria de una vez?」"

msgid "Yuri「That's right. For me to be a \"ma'am\"＿without being married...... I thought＿perhaps I look older than I am, and it」"
msgstr "Yuri「Así es. Que me digan \"señora\" sin estar＿casada...... Pensé que tal vez parezco＿mayor de lo que soy, y eso」"

msgid "Yuri「made me kind of sad.」"
msgstr "Yuri「me puso un poco triste.」"

msgid "Yuri「Of course! It means they thought stuff＿like \"Aww, she probably came to get＿ingredients to make her beloved」"
msgstr "Yuri「¡Claro! Pensaron algo como \"Ay,＿seguro vino a comprar ingredientes＿para prepararle a su amado」"

msgid "Yuri「husband a fine dinner.\"」"
msgstr "Yuri「esposo una buena cena.\"」"

msgid "Ami「Hey, could you quit with your weird＿comments? Ami-chan will always be＿popular, so there's absolutely no」"
msgstr "Ami「Oye, ¿podrías dejar tus comentarios＿raros? Ami-chan siempre será popular,＿así que ¡no hay absolutamente ninguna」"

msgid "Ami「chance of that!」"
msgstr "Ami「posibilidad de eso!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Are these the ones Noto said he＿dropped earlier? He was saying I could＿have them, but that just doesn't feel）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Son estas las que Noto dijo que se＿le cayeron antes? Decía que me las podía＿quedar, pero no me parece）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（right......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（correcto......）」"
